msgid ""
"**Description**: Get detailed information about a specific conda package "
"from a specific channel on Anaconda.org. Returns the package's full "
"metadata including description, all versions, platform availability, "
"download counts, home URL, license, and owner details. Use the format "
"'{channel}/{package\\_name}' (e.g., 'conda-forge/numpy', "
"'bioconda/samtools', 'defaults/scipy')."
msgstr ""

